// This template ships with no business domain on purpose — nothing to delete
// and nothing to mislead you (or a coding assistant) about what this project is.
//
// `User` above is the worked example: it exercises the full stack — schema ->
// repository -> service -> controller — with pagination, whitelisted filtering,
// whitelisted sorting and search. Copy `src/modules/user/` as the starting
// shape for your first real model, and see docs/adding-a-module.md for the
// step-by-step version.
